            "name": "title",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "The \"Deny log on as a service\" user right on Windows domain-joined systems must be configured to prevent access from highly privileged domain accounts."
          },
          {
